  message: "Fixed in PR #2926 (merged manually). Final PR shipped 3 commits: (1) f10e20a68 — initial split state file + scripts/agent-notes tool, (2) 4536f2cac — dropped self-healing migration per review (reviewer: 'built a feature to hide a defect'), cleaned all non-tracker references to last_stop_check.json throughout the repo, fixed pre-existing path-mismatch bug in test_hooks.sh scenario 8a, (3) 971ee0600 — guarded _maybe_auto_sync against tracker_root outside repo_root (separate hang bug discovered during testing).\n\nPositive evidence the invariant holds:\n- ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/guidance_log/last_stop_check.json: does not exist on disk\n- ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/guidance_log/stop_hook_state.json: exists, written only by stop_logic.sh (and verified single writer via grep)\n- ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/guidance_log/agent_notes.json: exists, written only by scripts/agent-notes (single writer by construction, CLI only accepts --set/--append/--show/--clear)\n- Every non-tracker reference to last_stop_check.json in the repo has been cleaned up: AGENTS.md, .agent/hooks/claude-code/stop.sh (circuit breaker REASON), .agent/hooks/_shared/on_transcript_change.py (playbook injection), .agent/hooks/_shared/stop_logic.sh, .agent/cooldown_prompt.md, .agent/stop_reflect.md, .githooks/test_hooks.sh, scripts/ci-failover, docs/GOVERNANCE.md, .agent/agent_playbooks_protocols_sops_skills/{recover-state-playbook,agentic-session-retrospective}.md, .gitignore. Only CHANGELOG historical entries and tracker .ops files retain the old name as audit trail.\n\nFollow-ups:\n- INV-pofam (P2 violated): test_hooks.sh scenarios 8c/8d-1 silently failing due to PID ancestor walk short-circuit; the fact that this went undetected means test_hooks.sh is not in CI. Lab notebook: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_04102026_2327.md."  # 1c61
